# 电商资源代理；在广告/隐私拦截之后匹配

# Shopify shared CDN for storefront assets and merchant files.
# Repeated keyboard image-range and VIA definition downloads favored the US proxy sample.
# This shared host also serves scripts; a domain rule cannot distinguish tracking-script paths.
# https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/best-practices/performance/use-shopify-cdn
DOMAIN,cdn.shopify.com

# Ozon site and static resources. Root redirects/challenges are not speed samples;
# retain the observed proxy direction without widening to either parent domain.
DOMAIN,www.ozon.ru
DOMAIN,www\.ozon.ru
DOMAIN,cdn2.ozone.ru
DOMAIN,st.ozone.ru

# Trip.com static resources; the separate UBT collector is rejected in the INI.
DOMAIN,ak-s.tripcdn.com
